This package is a modified copy of the lezer-promql grammar from
https://github.com/prometheus/prometheus/tree/main/web/ui/module/lezer-promql
distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Changes from upstream, published as @oxynote/lezer-promql:

  - src/promql.grammar: added the DynamicDurationPlaceholder token and
    accepted it as a number, so Grafana-style placeholders ($__interval,
    $__range, $__rate_interval) parse as durations.
  - src/highlight.js: styled DynamicDurationPlaceholder as a number.
  - package.json: renamed the package.

See packages/README.lezer-promql.md for the upstream sync procedure.
